#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%2375
msgid "Defining Surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%2376
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">Surface is "
"combination of three parameters: Screen(Output) name and optional "
"VirtualDesktops and ActivityId. For example:</span></p><p><span style=\" "
"font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">HDMI-A-1:Desktop 1:99e10d31-e8f3-44aa-"
"bbed-2a543f13fa54- </span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">this uniquely "
"defines one surface, another example defines group of surfaces: </span><span "
"style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">DP-2 </span><span style=\" font-"
"size:12pt;\">- this include all surfaces with any activities and virtual "
"desktops on monitor DP-2. To define a surface for further use in program "
"configuration use the next format: </span></p><p><span style=\" font-"
"size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">"
"label=&lt;outputName&gt;,&lt;outputName&gt;...[:&lt;virtualDesktop&gt;,&lt;virtualDesktop&gt;...[:&lt;activityId&gt;]] "
"</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">For example:</span><span "
"style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\"> allMonitors=: </span><span "
"style=\" font-size:12pt;\">to make label for all monitors or</span><span "
"style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\"> mainScreen=HDMI-A-1,DP-"
"2:Desktop 1 </span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">in another parts of "
"Krohnkite config you can use </span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-"
"weight:700;\">mainMonitor</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\"> as surface "
"name(</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">All Case "
"Sensitive)</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">.Please note that there "
"may be multiple monitor names, separated by commas as in the example, or "
"there may be none. The first one has higher priority and if this monitor "
"works in this moment the surface in example will belong ONLY him NOT "
"BOTH.This can be useful if you apply monitor to your notebook for example "
"and you want the monitor to have this config. </span></p></body></html>"
msgstr ""

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%2377
msgid "Surfaces Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: KrohnkiteConfigForm%2378
msgid ""
"<html><head/><body><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">Overriding default "
"parameters for every surface. Format: </span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; "
"font-weight:700;\">SrfLabel:param=value,param=value... &lt;Enter&gt;</span></"
"p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">Possible parameters(case insensetive): "
"</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">capacity</span>"
"<span style=\" font-size:12pt;\"> or </span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; "
"font-weight:700;\">cp; overcapacity </span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">"
"or</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\"> oc </span></p><p>"
"For example: </p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">"
"primaryScreen:cp=6,oc=false</span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">"
"Next example set capacity on surface(s)  with Label = primaryScreen  and "
"disable overcapacity windows movement on them.</span></p></body></html>"
msgstr ""

