"left,right,top,bottom,between</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\"> or you "
"can use shortname</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\"> "
"l,r,t,b,e </span></p><p><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\">You can only write "
"down the parameters you want to change. Examples:</span></p><p><span "
"style=\" font-size:12pt;\">on your defined surface(see surfaces tab) with "
"name: </span><span style=\" font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">"
"myFirstMonitor</span><span style=\" font-size:12pt;\"> will override right "
"gap to 10, left gap to 20 and between gap to 10</span></p><p><span style=\" "
"font-size:12pt; font-weight:700;\">MyFirstMonitor:r=10,l=20,between=10</span>"
"</p></body></html>"
